    {
      "claim": "This trace does not establish a predominantly passive GPU synchronization wait.",
      "evidence": "Renderer thread CPU is 92.7% of wall time in third-A2 and 91.3% in first-A2; FunctionCall thread time also accounts for most FunctionCall wall time. Render self samples are distributed among Three traversal/program/uniform/binding operations. Trace categories do not provide a complete GPU/driver wait timeline."
    },
    {
      "claim": "A stable city rendering cost cannot be calculated from this ABA.",
      "evidence": "Visible A1 versus A2 differs strongly (third 65→42.12 FPS, first 53.33→35.15 FPS), despite similar draw/triangle counts. Order-dependent drift confounds visible-versus-hidden subtraction."
